{"text": "Let go, You are hurting me, cried the Elephants Child through his nose. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Then the Python spoke from the bank. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Pull as hard as you can, my young friend, he said. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> The Elephants Child pulled, and the Crocodile pulled. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> His nose was getting longer and longer. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Then the Python wrapped himself around the Elephants Childs back legs. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> They pulled harder and harder, and at last the Crocodile let go. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> There was a loud plop, and the Elephants Child sat down hard. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> He wrapped his poor nose in cool banana leaves. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Then he hung it in the river to cool. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> He sat and waited for three days, but his nose never got shorter.", "alignment": {"characters": ["L", "e", "t", " ", "g", "o", ",", " ", "Y", "o", "u", " ", "a", "r", "e", " ", "h", "u", "r", "t", "i", "n", "g", " ", "m", "e", ",", " ", "c", "r", "i", "e", "d", " ", "t", "h", "e", " ", "E", "l", "e", "p", "h", "a", "n", "t", "s", " ", "C", "h", "i", "l", "d", " ", "t", "h", "r", "o", "u", "g", "h", " ", "h", "i", "s", " ", "n", "o", "s", "e", ".", " ", "<", "b", "r", "e", "a", "k", " ", "t", "i", "m", "e", "=", "\"", "0", ".", "8", "s", "\"", " ", "/", ">", " ", "T", "h", "e", "n", " ", "t", "h", "e", " ", "P", "y", "t", "h", "o", "n", " ", "s", "p", "o", "k", "e", " ", "f", "r", "o", "m", " ", "t", "h", "e", " ", "b", "a", "n", "k", ".", " ", "<", "b", "r", "e", "a", "k", " ", "t", "i", "m", "e", "=", "\"", "0", ".", "8", "s", "\"", " ", "/", ">", " ", "P", "u", "l", "l", " ", "a", "s", " ", "h", "a", "r", "d", " ", "a", "s", " ", "y", "o", "u", " ", "c", "a", "n", ",", " ", "m", "y", " ", "y", "o", "u", "n", "g", " ", "f", "r", "i", "e", "n", "d", ",", " ", "h", "e", " ", "s", "a", "i", "d", ".", " ", "<", "b", "r", "e", "a", "k", " ", "t", "i", "m", "e", "=", "\"", "0", ".", "8", "s", "\"",